        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Runner Frog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner Frog</strong> is a fast-paced 2D platformer with a speedrun twist.<br>Take control of a determined frog and dash through dangerous levels full of traps, platforms, and apples to collect. The goal is simple but addictive: <strong>finish each stage as fast as possible, with the fewest deaths, and the most apples gathered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise controls and handcrafted challenges, Runner Frog offers the perfect mix of speed, difficulty, and replayability. Every death is just another chance to improve your run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-focused gameplay</strong>: master stages and aim for faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong> based on three factors: time, deaths, and apples collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight and responsive controls</strong> designed for precision platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro pixel art style</strong>, colorful and nostalgic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> that tests your skill with every new stage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 What You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you purchase <strong>Runner Frog</strong>, you receive the full game with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All <strong>50 playable levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in <strong>speedrun challenges</strong> for every stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>apple collection system</strong> to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value for those chasing the perfect run.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Runner Frog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner Frog</strong> is a fast-paced 2D platformer with a speedrun twist.<br>Take control of a determined frog and dash through dangerous levels full of traps, platforms, and apples to collect. The goal is simple but addictive: <strong>finish each stage as fast as possible, with the fewest deaths, and the most apples gathered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise controls and handcrafted challenges, Runner Frog offers the perfect mix of speed, difficulty, and replayability. Every death is just another chance to improve your run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 handcrafted levels</strong>, each with unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-focused gameplay</strong>: master stages and aim for faster times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong> based on three factors: time, deaths, and apples collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight and responsive controls</strong> designed for precision platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro pixel art style</strong>, colorful and nostalgic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> that tests your skill with every new stage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 What You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you purchase <strong>Runner Frog</strong>, you receive the full game with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All <strong>50 playable levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in <strong>speedrun challenges</strong> for every stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>apple collection system</strong> to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value for those chasing the perfect run.</p></li></ul>",
